      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "When all twenty sacks of potatoes are peeled on time thanks to the whole kitchen pitching in, German gathers the staff and uses Denis's apparent productivity as an excuse to fire two cooks. Let's hear the dialogue in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
